  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total time required=(total number of dials required to sure open the lock)<math><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>s</mtext></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>s</mtext></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>500000</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn></math> days are enough to open the safe.",
